Third-party dependencies

Modelly depends on the following projects at runtime. They are not vendored
in this repository; the list below is a courtesy, and each project's own
license governs its use.

  numpy        BSD-3-Clause
  pandas       BSD-3-Clause
  scipy        BSD-3-Clause
  tqdm         MPL-2.0 AND MIT
  networkx     BSD-3-Clause        (optional: modelly[network])
  solara       MIT                 (optional: modelly[viz])
  matplotlib   PSF-based           (optional: modelly[viz])
  altair       BSD-3-Clause        (optional: modelly[viz])
  starlette    BSD-3-Clause        (optional: modelly[viz])

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled data

modelly/space/geo/data holds three small geospatial samples of Burlington,
Vermont, each under its own licence, listed with its attribution and source
in modelly/space/geo/data/NOTICE.md:

  burlington_roads.graphml    ODbL 1.0, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors
  burlington_landcover.tif    CC BY 4.0, (c) ESA WorldCover project 2021
  burlington_tracts.geojson   public domain, U.S. Census Bureau
